# The compat-test image is built from the repository root because it needs both
# compat-tests/ and the packed nupkg. Everything else is excluded so the build
# context stays small (step-down allow-list: a child can only be re-included if
# none of its parent directories are excluded).
*
!compat-tests
!artifacts
artifacts/*
!artifacts/BlackFox.MasterOfFoo
artifacts/BlackFox.MasterOfFoo/*
!artifacts/BlackFox.MasterOfFoo/Release
artifacts/BlackFox.MasterOfFoo/Release/*
!artifacts/BlackFox.MasterOfFoo/Release/*.nupkg
